"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>山田クンの死体があったのは、
#. １階の保健室だ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0037 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Hifumi's body was in the nurse's office on the 1st\n"
